'' TKO0860: A NAME THE INTERFACE DOES NOT CALL 'public' is not found through the module's
'' namespace -- neither qualified, 'http.Add_', nor unqualified through 'using http' --
'' though the module's own generic body, instantiated in the importer, calls it
'' (iface-link.test). ADR 0017; RFC-0002 §3.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i tests/modules/src/iface/libs tests/diagnostics/src/modules/alias/hidden.bas -o tests/diagnostics/notpublic.exe
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: hidden.bas(3,22): error TKO0860: 'add_' is not public in module 'acme.net.http'
'' EXPECT-OUT: hidden.bas(5,7): error TKO0860: 'add_' is not public in module 'acme.net.http'
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0745
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0743
